"### HYPE vs Crypto \u2014 is it crypto-beta or a hedge?\n\nCorrelation of daily returns to BTC \u2014 **all-history 0.53**, **90-day 0.64**, **30-day 0.54**; **beta \u2248 1.28**.\n\nRead: HYPE is currently **high-beta crypto** (moves *with* BTC, amplified). This is the crux of the bull/bear model \u2014 if usage & fees are **crypto-beta**, the buyback flywheel *amplifies* in a bull run and *reverses* in a bear; if HYPE volume holds up when BTC falls (traders using perps to **go short / hedge**), the cash flows are more defensive than the token price implies.\n\n<sub>Prices: Hyperliquid daily candles (HYPE) & OKX (BTC), keyless. Correlation \u2260 causation; short history \u2014 treat as directional.</sub>"